WEBVTT

00:01:31.440 --> 00:01:37.240
The Takao/Max team will face off
against the Zeo/Gordo team.

00:01:37.610 --> 00:01:40.450
Do you know
why I'm strong?

00:01:40.740 --> 00:01:43.790
It's because I'm
fighting for myself.

00:01:43.790 --> 00:01:48.000
It's not for some vapid nonsense
like friendship or teamwork.

00:01:48.250 --> 00:01:49.750
It's for me!

00:01:50.080 --> 00:01:55.760
Kai, after losing Suzaku,
decided to quit Beyblade.

00:01:55.760 --> 00:01:59.050
The BBA team was on
the verge of splitting up.

00:01:59.050 --> 00:02:03.060
But we were able to come together
again thanks to Hiromi's hard work.

00:02:03.600 --> 00:02:11.270
Meanwhile, the Chairman and I are getting
closer and closer to a hidden, shocking truth.

00:02:27.620 --> 00:02:30.290
Ladies and gentlemen!

00:02:30.290 --> 00:02:36.630
It's time to start the final match for
the 2002 world championships!

00:02:42.140 --> 00:02:43.720
Here we go.

00:02:53.190 --> 00:02:55.940
I wonder where
Kyoujyu went?

00:03:02.660 --> 00:03:03.780
Chairman!

00:03:06.740 --> 00:03:08.540
How was Zeo?

00:03:09.660 --> 00:03:15.500
We have no other way of finding
the truth other than asking Zagart himself.

00:03:16.460 --> 00:03:17.510
I see...

00:03:18.130 --> 00:03:21.220
If what you
hypothesize is correct...

00:03:22.470 --> 00:03:26.310
then what I'm most worried
about is Zagart's motive.

00:03:28.730 --> 00:03:31.520
As you know, the Bladers
in the finals will be

00:03:31.520 --> 00:03:37.650
the Takao Kinomiya/Max Mizuhara team VS the Zeo/Gordo team!

00:03:38.320 --> 00:03:42.320
Which pair will become
the world champion?

00:03:42.530 --> 00:03:45.660
The Bladers enter the stadium!

00:04:03.510 --> 00:04:06.720
Where were you?
This is important...

00:04:06.720 --> 00:04:08.180
I had to go to
the restroom!

00:04:10.140 --> 00:04:11.560
Takao!

00:04:11.560 --> 00:04:13.560
Mr. Kinomiya!

00:04:21.570 --> 00:04:29.540
The matchups for the first and second battles will
be decided on by registration name order!

00:04:30.160 --> 00:04:34.000
Here are the matchups!

00:04:36.420 --> 00:04:38.090
The first battle

00:04:38.420 --> 00:04:42.090
is between
Kinomiya and Gordo!

00:04:42.260 --> 00:04:44.590
And the second battle

00:04:44.590 --> 00:04:48.100
is Mizuhara and Zeo!

00:04:56.900 --> 00:05:00.530
Let's get the
first battle underway!

00:05:00.900 --> 00:05:04.990
Takao Kinomiya VS Gordo!

00:05:06.950 --> 00:05:10.990
Gordo is good
enough to tie with Rei!

00:05:11.410 --> 00:05:13.580
We can't underestimate him.

00:05:16.870 --> 00:05:19.250
Your Seiryu is mine!

00:05:20.210 --> 00:05:21.960
You're going down!

00:05:22.630 --> 00:05:24.090
Are you ready?

00:05:24.970 --> 00:05:27.840
Three! Two! One!

00:05:28.180 --> 00:05:30.560
--Go, Shoot!

00:05:33.850 --> 00:05:35.140
Seventy-thousand?!

00:05:35.360 --> 00:05:37.300
That's a new record for him!

00:05:37.810 --> 00:05:39.690
Dragoon!

00:05:42.190 --> 00:05:43.610
Go!

00:05:47.910 --> 00:05:50.910
Is this the power of the
High-Power Custom?

00:05:50.910 --> 00:05:55.540
Takao Kinomiya dishes out a
relentless attack right off the bat!

00:05:56.000 --> 00:05:59.250
Takao's into it more
than he usually is...

00:06:02.840 --> 00:06:04.840
I won't let you
have your way!

00:06:14.470 --> 00:06:18.730
Gordo shows some backbone
and counterattacks!

00:06:19.060 --> 00:06:22.230
This is just what you'd expect
from the best in the world!

00:06:22.610 --> 00:06:24.780
The Bey destroyed in
the battle with Rei

00:06:24.780 --> 00:06:27.360
is back and several
times more powerful!

00:06:28.530 --> 00:06:30.320
Go, Orthros!

00:06:36.750 --> 00:06:37.710
Takao!

00:06:37.710 --> 00:06:38.500
Now!

00:06:38.660 --> 00:06:41.040
Orthros!

00:07:07.440 --> 00:07:08.820
Mr. Kinomiya!

00:07:09.030 --> 00:07:13.950
Uh-oh! Kinomiya's got his
back against the wall!

00:07:15.700 --> 00:07:18.040
Seiryu!!

00:07:24.590 --> 00:07:27.050
Defeat is not an option!

00:07:27.050 --> 00:07:28.760
I will win!

00:07:29.300 --> 00:07:31.970
Go, Seiryu!

00:07:41.060 --> 00:07:43.900
Twin Spear!

00:07:50.530 --> 00:07:52.490
Orthros's special move?!

00:08:15.640 --> 00:08:18.720
Kinomiya's Bey
has powered down!

00:08:18.720 --> 00:08:21.640
Just what happened?

00:08:25.480 --> 00:08:26.650
Orthros!

00:08:34.320 --> 00:08:35.570
I won't lose!

00:08:35.820 --> 00:08:37.700
Like hell I'm gonna lose!

00:08:50.550 --> 00:08:53.720
Hyper Victory Tornado!

00:09:26.870 --> 00:09:29.880
Kinomiya wins!

00:09:32.460 --> 00:09:35.220
Yay! He won!

00:09:50.730 --> 00:09:53.230
That was a wonderful battle.

00:09:55.740 --> 00:09:57.490
Nice battle, Takao.

00:09:57.490 --> 00:09:59.820
You got this, Max.

00:10:04.200 --> 00:10:08.790
Up next is the second
battle! Mizuhara VS Zeo!

00:10:12.090 --> 00:10:13.800
I hope you're ready.

00:10:15.340 --> 00:10:19.140
Kai, I promise I'll
get revenge for you!

00:10:21.600 --> 00:10:23.600
Now's the time...

00:10:23.890 --> 00:10:27.180
Go for it, Max!
Just one more win!

00:10:27.980 --> 00:10:29.650
Are you ready?

00:10:30.770 --> 00:10:33.520
Three! Two! One!

00:10:33.520 --> 00:10:36.150
Go, Shoot!

00:10:40.160 --> 00:10:41.530
Zeo...

00:10:41.530 --> 00:10:43.280
Just what are you...?

00:10:49.330 --> 00:10:50.330
Wow...

00:10:54.550 --> 00:10:55.800
Max...

00:10:58.380 --> 00:11:01.390
Go, Draciel!!

00:11:02.510 --> 00:11:12.440
"Bakuten Shoot Beyblade 2002"

00:11:14.230 --> 00:11:15.520
Draciel!!

00:11:20.240 --> 00:11:23.660
Mizuhara goes in
for the first hit!

00:11:29.120 --> 00:11:33.920
Zeo keeps calm and
dodges Max's attacks!

00:11:33.920 --> 00:11:35.170
Get back here!

00:11:35.170 --> 00:11:36.590
Genbu!

00:11:41.550 --> 00:11:44.550
Max is going straight
for the finish!

00:11:50.680 --> 00:11:51.810
Incredible!

00:11:51.810 --> 00:11:55.110
Mizuhara keeps
up the attack!

00:11:58.280 --> 00:12:00.820
Zeo's stone cold...

00:12:01.530 --> 00:12:03.780
He's eerily calm...

00:12:06.080 --> 00:12:08.830
Cerberus!

00:12:46.780 --> 00:12:51.870
Look out! Zeo has changed
from defense mode to attack!

00:12:52.410 --> 00:12:55.000
Keep attacking!

00:12:55.000 --> 00:12:57.130
Burning Cerberus!

00:12:57.840 --> 00:12:58.670
Zeo...

00:13:12.180 --> 00:13:15.310
Burning Cerberus!

00:13:22.320 --> 00:13:24.280
I will take Genbu!

00:13:25.820 --> 00:13:27.240
No you won't!

00:13:32.950 --> 00:13:34.540
Draciel!

00:13:40.000 --> 00:13:41.300
Max...

00:13:42.210 --> 00:13:44.510
I've never seen
Max like this...

00:13:44.510 --> 00:13:47.550
Go, Draciel!!

00:13:56.350 --> 00:13:58.150
The noise won't stop!

00:13:58.480 --> 00:14:00.060
This hasn't
happened before!

00:14:06.780 --> 00:14:07.740
Zeo...

00:14:11.660 --> 00:14:14.040
Hey! Where are
you going, Kyoujyu?!

00:14:20.920 --> 00:14:21.960
Chairman!

00:14:23.130 --> 00:14:24.800
What's the matter, Kyoujyu?

00:14:25.090 --> 00:14:28.090
I think something terrible
is about to happen!

00:14:33.890 --> 00:14:37.850
Let's go see Zagart and confirm
the truth for ourselves!

00:14:38.600 --> 00:14:40.650
Draciel!!

00:15:02.000 --> 00:15:03.500
Zagart.

00:15:03.500 --> 00:15:06.300
We need to ask
you something.

00:15:11.300 --> 00:15:14.810
I'm surprised you noticed.
Well done, Daitenji.

00:15:15.560 --> 00:15:17.890
Does that mean
Zeo is really a--

00:15:17.890 --> 00:15:20.390
Zagart, why would
you do such a thing?

00:15:26.400 --> 00:15:29.030
Please, stop Zeo now!

00:15:29.030 --> 00:15:30.400
I can't do that.

00:15:31.410 --> 00:15:33.820
What do you
mean you can't?

00:15:33.820 --> 00:15:36.950
He's taking orders
from you, his father!

00:15:36.950 --> 00:15:38.200
You're wrong.

00:15:38.200 --> 00:15:39.410
What?

00:15:39.540 --> 00:15:42.540
I am the one who
originally gave him orders.

00:15:42.540 --> 00:15:44.290
But now that's
not the case.

00:15:44.290 --> 00:15:48.710
Zeo is fighting for
himself on his own will.

00:15:48.960 --> 00:15:51.380
I don't have the
right to stop him.

00:15:51.380 --> 00:15:52.720
No...!

00:16:02.980 --> 00:16:05.860
You're finished! Draciel!!

00:16:07.360 --> 00:16:08.280
What?!

00:16:09.820 --> 00:16:13.570
Heavy Viper Wall!!!

00:16:29.850 --> 00:16:30.940
Zeo...

00:16:33.130 --> 00:16:35.610
If he fights any longer
he'll be in danger!

00:16:37.470 --> 00:16:41.390
I cannot accept defeat!

00:16:42.480 --> 00:16:45.310
Burning Cerberus!

00:16:54.910 --> 00:16:58.030
Suzaku!!

00:17:15.880 --> 00:17:17.180
What happened?!

00:17:17.180 --> 00:17:18.430
Cerberus...

00:17:18.430 --> 00:17:21.100
Has absorbed
Suzaku's power!

00:17:33.940 --> 00:17:34.530
Genbu!

00:17:34.530 --> 00:17:39.280
Go! Burning Cerberus!

00:17:41.030 --> 00:17:43.870
Zeo's powerful
counterattack!

00:17:43.870 --> 00:17:46.670
Can Mizuhara
take the heat?

00:17:46.670 --> 00:17:48.500
Hang in there, Max!

00:17:56.260 --> 00:17:58.180
Genbu is mine
for the taking!

00:17:58.180 --> 00:18:01.510
Chain Storm!

00:18:16.650 --> 00:18:17.820
Genbu...

00:18:21.200 --> 00:18:23.740
Cerberus!

00:18:42.210 --> 00:18:43.260
Yes.

00:18:44.430 --> 00:18:47.890
Zeo is the winner!

00:18:50.270 --> 00:18:52.150
My Genbu...

00:18:52.980 --> 00:18:55.110
Now it's even, one-to-one!

00:18:55.110 --> 00:19:02.030
The battle between Kinomiya and
Zeo will decide the world champion!

00:19:04.580 --> 00:19:05.700
Takao...

00:19:05.910 --> 00:19:07.080
Sorry.

00:19:08.000 --> 00:19:09.580
I'll take it from here.

00:19:12.210 --> 00:19:16.250
The final battle will
be Kinomiya VS Zeo!

00:19:16.250 --> 00:19:20.010
The 2002 world championships
are at the climax!

00:19:20.010 --> 00:19:24.600
Like it or not, this
is the final battle!

00:19:25.100 --> 00:19:30.980
The title of number one Blader in
the world all rides on this match!

00:19:32.690 --> 00:19:35.270
The time has finally
come, Kinomiya.

00:19:35.270 --> 00:19:38.240
I will take Seiryu even
if it costs me my life.

00:19:40.400 --> 00:19:43.320
Calm down, Kyoujyu.

00:19:47.120 --> 00:19:50.080
I could never wrap
my head around it.

00:19:50.080 --> 00:19:53.540
Why our friend would
turn his back on us?

00:19:53.540 --> 00:19:56.290
Why he'd be so
determined to beat us?

00:19:56.290 --> 00:19:59.920
But now that he stole
Suzaku and Genbu...

00:19:59.920 --> 00:20:02.930
I don't have any
reason to hesitate!

00:20:03.430 --> 00:20:05.970
I will defeat you!

00:20:05.970 --> 00:20:08.560
For my friends.
For the four Sacred Beasts.

00:20:08.560 --> 00:20:10.770
And for myself!

00:20:10.980 --> 00:20:13.060
I've been waiting
for this, Kinomiya.

00:20:13.270 --> 00:20:14.730
Bring it, Zeo.

00:20:15.150 --> 00:20:16.570
Are you ready?

00:20:17.480 --> 00:20:18.110
Three!

00:20:18.110 --> 00:20:19.740
No, stop...

00:20:19.740 --> 00:20:20.860
Two!

00:20:20.860 --> 00:20:22.070
If he keeps this up,
Zeo's body will...

00:20:22.070 --> 00:20:23.030
--One!

00:20:24.450 --> 00:20:26.810
Go, Shoot!

00:20:27.120 --> 00:20:31.660
Whoa! Both of their
RPM are insanely high!

00:20:43.380 --> 00:20:44.810
Kyoujyu?

00:20:46.760 --> 00:20:48.850
What's the matter, Kyoujyu?

00:20:48.850 --> 00:20:50.470
Why are you crying?

00:20:50.470 --> 00:20:51.680
Kyoujyu...

00:20:52.140 --> 00:20:53.440
Zeo is...

00:20:53.440 --> 00:20:55.850
Zeo is not human!!

00:20:56.100 --> 00:20:56.940
What?!

00:20:56.940 --> 00:20:58.900
I don't really...

00:20:59.320 --> 00:21:02.860
Go! Burning Cerberus!

00:21:05.910 --> 00:21:08.490
I will defeat Takao Kinomiya!

00:21:22.800 --> 00:21:23.800
Zeo...!

00:21:31.060 --> 00:21:32.470
Zeo...

00:21:32.470 --> 00:21:34.060
You're a...

00:22:59.060 --> 00:23:01.980
The finals are down
to the last battle.

00:23:01.980 --> 00:23:04.610
Takao has to free
the Sacred Beasts.

00:23:04.770 --> 00:23:06.400
Zeo has injured his arm.

00:23:06.400 --> 00:23:10.070
But what's certain is that both of
them are giving it all they've got.

00:23:10.070 --> 00:23:12.320
You won't be able to
take your eyes off!

00:23:12.320 --> 00:23:13.780
What's that, Chairman?

00:23:13.780 --> 00:23:15.910
"Where are your eyes?"

00:23:15.910 --> 00:23:17.290
How rude!

00:23:17.290 --> 00:23:18.500
Huh? I don't have any?

00:23:19.870 --> 00:23:21.960
Don't miss the next episode!
